% formalizes: claim:lib-9a
% claim: A loan still out six weeks after its due date is declared lost
% says: A loan that is still out six weeks after its due date is declared lost.
% fidelity: yes — with "six weeks after" a given relation between day numbers. "Still out" is read as not returned rather than open, because open is defined as not lost and the rule would otherwise go round in a circle.
declared_lost(L) :- loan(L), not returned(L), loan_due(L, D), six_weeks_after(D, D6), today(N), D6 < N.
